   "role": "major",
   "firstAppearance": "s9",
   "summary": "First mention: “I was going to tell you how many unmistakeable admirers I had:—Sir Thomas Ashby was one,—Sir Hugh Meltham and Sir Broadley Wilson are old codgers, only fit companions for papa and mamma.”"
  },
  {
   "id": "agnes",
   "name": "Agnes",
   "role": "major",
