   "name": "Rector",
   "role": "supporting",
   "firstAppearance": "s11",
   "summary": "First mention: “He comes to see all us poor bodies a deal ofter nor Maister Bligh, or th’ Rector ever did; an’ it’s well he does, for he’s always welcome: we can’t say as much for th’ Rector—there is ’at says they’re fair feared on him.”"
  },
